            <ArticleTitle>[Some features of gastric disorders in occupational diseases].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>10-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Some features were revealed after study of 185 patients with various occupational diseases: chronic lead intoxication, bronchial asthma, and disorders caused by fluor. Considering polyetiology and nonspecificity of gastric diseases, the authors could not determine the changes revealed as caused only by occupational exposure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
